UnitPoolTape::ObserveSingle
├── when the pool has no recorded swap
│   └── it returns a zeroed observation
├── when secondsAgo is eq to zero
│   └── it returns the current accumulator as an observation
└── when secondsAgo is gt zero
    ├── when secondsAgo is gte the current block time
    │   └── it sets the target to zero and returns the oldest observation
    └── when secondsAgo is lt the current block time
        ├── when the target is gte the last swap timestamp
        │   └── it returns the current accumulator as an observation with the target timestamp
        └── when the target is lt the last swap timestamp
            ├── when the target is gte the upper bound
            │   └── it returns the upper bound observation
            ├── when the target is lte the lower bound
            │   └── it returns the lower bound observation
            └── when the target is strictly between the bounds
                └── it returns the interpolation between the bounds
